Z||000001||Brandon86SE||11-18-2001||01:52 AM||||If you have power windows, the best place to put them is in the doors.  Ricecooker has this setup, and his car sounds great!  If you have crank windows the crank is in the way though.  Some people have put them in the front factory location, but you will have to do some cutting.  I looked into doing this, and decided against it.  Best of luck to ya though!<P>Brandon<P>------------------<BR>    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Field_Front_(sig)_1.jpg"> ||||reg||1
